

# Which app's trades count toward the growth challenge.
#
# MUST be the app id this site's FRONTEND places trades under (frontend/.env
# APP_ID), which is NOT the markup app id. Leave it unset and nothing matches,
# so the challenge sits at zero forever rather than paying out on trades placed
# in DTrader or on another site.
#
# To confirm it, look at the app_id on a real row of your own profit_table.
DERIV_TRADING_APP_ID=
